# NVLink / NVSwitch intra-server domain for the 2048-GPU rail cluster.
# 256 servers x 8 GPUs; each leaf = one server's NVSwitch (8 GPUs on a 3600 Gbps
# non-blocking crossbar, 100 ns links). Consecutive attachment (no "Rails"), so
# leaf s owns GPUs 8s..8s+7 = exactly one server.
# Only intra-server flows attach here, so traffic never leaves a leaf and Tier 1
# is inert -- it exists solely because htsim requires >= 2 tiers.
Nodes 2048
Tiers 2
Podsize 2048

Tier 0
Oversubscribed 8
Downlink_speed_Gbps 3600
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 100
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 3600
Radix_Down 256
Downlink_Latency_ns 100
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 1
